description:
Design a 3-bit up counter that increments its count on each positive clock edge. The counter resets to 000 when the reset signal is deactivated (active low). Once the counter reaches its maximum value of 111, it wraps around back to 000. This module can be utilized in applications requiring counting operations or timing sequences.
module top_module(
    input clk,
    input rst,
    output reg [2:0] count
);

