description:
Design a 3-to-8 line binary decoder. The module takes a 3-bit binary input and activates one of the eight output lines corresponding to the binary value of the input. For each unique input value, a single output is set high while all other outputs remain low, effectively translating the input binary value into a one-hot encoded output.
module top_module(
  input [2:0] binary_in,
  output reg [7:0] binary_out
);

